<h2 id="photos" class="mk-section-header">Project Photo Library</h2>
<p class="mk-crosslink">Curated, client-ready project photography. Need the full raw archive — showroom shots, details, screenshots? Browse <a href="/dealer-hub/downloads#photos">all dealer photos</a> on Forms &amp; Downloads.</p>
<p>Every installed dealer project we've documented, available for use in your own marketing. Click any card to view the full project gallery and additional photos. Click <strong>Download Image</strong> to save the hero shot for your website, social media, or pitch decks.</p>

<div class="mk-usage-note">
  <strong>Usage rights:</strong> Pinnacle Sales dealers may use these photos for marketing as long as (1) the cabinetry brand is credited in the caption or alt text, (2) the photo is not heavily cropped or edited beyond standard color/exposure adjustments, and (3) Pinnacle Sales is tagged when posted on Instagram or LinkedIn. <a href="mailto:marketing@pinnaclesales.biz">Email marketing@pinnaclesales.biz</a> for higher-resolution originals or special usage requests.
</div>

<div class="photo-library">
  {galleryProjects.map(p => (
    <div class="photo-card">
      <a href={`/projects/${p.slug}`} class="photo-thumb">
        <img src={`/images/projects/${p.slug}/${p.hero}`} alt={p.title} loading="lazy" />
      </a>
      <div class="photo-meta">
