<p class="mk-format-note"><strong>File format note:</strong> Images are served as <code>.webp</code> for performance. If you need JPG or PNG for a platform that doesn't accept WebP (rare in 2026, but it happens), open the file in Preview / Photos / Photoshop and re-export.</p>

