<h3>Posting Cadence</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Frequency:</strong> 2–4 posts per week per platform. Quality over quantity — one strong install photo beats five filler shots.</li>
  <li><strong>Best times:</strong> Tuesday–Thursday, late morning (10am–noon local) or early evening (6–8pm local). LinkedIn skews mornings; Instagram skews evenings.</li>
  <li><strong>Mix:</strong> Aim for ~60% installed-project photos, ~20% process / behind-the-scenes (showroom, install crews, design sessions), ~20% educational (door styles, finish stories, brand differentiators).</li>
  <li><strong>Tag your suppliers:</strong> Tag <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pinnacle-sales-kbi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@PinnacleSales</a>, the brand (e.g. @ShilohCabinetry), and your installer / designer. Cross-tagging multiplies reach without extra effort.</li>
  <li><strong>Story / Reel mix:</strong> Stories work for in-progress and showroom shots; Reels work for finished walkthroughs. Both feed the main grid algorithm.</li>
</ul>

